          },
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "opener"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "opener-v1",
          "titleStyle": "display",
          "text": "About Me",
          "description": "Hi, I’m Alex. I’m a designer by heart, and I love the moment when a complicated idea starts to feel possible."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-idea",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 1.4,
          "focusWU": 1.8,
          "endWU": 2.2,
          "publishable": true,
          "flow": {
            "minScreens": 0.8,
            "gapAfter": "tight",
            "focusMode": "middle"
          },
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "center"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "titleStyle": "standard",
          "text": "Most new things arrive before we know what to do with them…"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-conditions",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 2.55,
          "focusWU": 2.95,
          "endWU": 3.35,
          "publishable": true,
          "flow": {
            "minScreens": 0.8,
            "gapAfter": "standard",
            "focusMode": "middle"
          },
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "center"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "titleStyle": "standard",
          "text": "…or how to feel about them."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-background-unit",
          "kind": "scroll-block",
          "startWU": 3.6,
          "focusWU": 4.1,
          "endWU": 7.05,
          "publishable": true,
          "flow": {
            "minScreens": 1.8,
            "gapAfter": "standard",
            "focusMode": "reading-start"
          },
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "reading"
          },
          "block": {
            "id": "background-unit",
            "kind": "stack",
            "modules": [
              {
                "id": "context",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "That is the part I find interesting. A product, service or technology can be useful long before it feels familiar. You can explain what it does, but that does not automatically make people want to use it, trust it or care about it."
              },
              {
                "id": "context-emphasis",
                "kind": "list",
                "items": [
                  "Design should give people a way in."
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "understanding",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "Sometimes that means simplifying. Sometimes it means slowing things down just enough for a decision to become visible. What matters is that the experience makes sense to the person using it, not only to the person who built it."
              },
              {
                "id": "education",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "People need a way to relate to something new. Language, appearance, behaviour and movement all influence whether an idea feels credible or worth their time."
              },
              {
                "id": "practice",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "That is why multidisciplinary design feels right for the age we are in."
              },
              {
                "id": "selected-clients",
                "kind": "logo-grid",
                "label": "I’ve been fortunate to work with influential organisations across automotive, aviation, charity, finance and technology.",
                "items": [
                  {
